  para="Education for sustainable development should underpin teaching, learning and assessment as well as the curriculum; the QAA and Advance HE guidance's three ways (thinking, practising, being) may help, and its interdisciplinary nature suits co-created, problem-based work with students, tutors and partners on real challenges.",
